{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m007-0744","start":744,"end":746,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005086","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m007-0768","start":768,"end":770,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005086","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m007-0787","start":787,"end":790,"surface":"淮南王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005060","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu","book_id":"b-shiji-091","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-091-qingbu"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:p008","text":"楚使者在，方急責英布發兵，舍傳舍。隨何直入，坐楚使者上坐，曰：「九江王已歸漢，楚何以得發兵？」布愕然。楚使者起。何因說布曰：「事已搆，可遂殺楚使者，無使歸，而疾走漢并力。」布曰：「如使者教，因起兵而擊之耳。」於是殺使者，因起兵而攻楚。楚使項聲、龍且攻淮南，項王留而攻下邑。數月，龍且擊淮南，破布軍。布欲引兵走漢，恐楚王殺之，故閒行與何俱歸漢。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m008-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"楚使者","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005081","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m008-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"英布","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005060","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m008-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"隨何","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005087","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m008-0023","start":23,"end":26,"surface":"楚使者","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005081","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m008-0032","start":32,"end":35,"surface":"九江王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005060","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m008-0047","start":47,"end":48,"surface":"布","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005060","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m008-0051","start":51,"end":54,"surface":"楚使者","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005081","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m008-0056","start":56,"end":57,"surface":"何","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005087","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m008-0059","start":59,"end":60,"surface":"布","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005060","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m008-0070","start":70,"end":73,"surface":"楚使者","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005081","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m008-0086","start":86,"end":87,"surface":"布","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005060","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m008-0119","start":119,"end":121,"surface":"項聲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005089","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m008-0122","start":122,"end":124,"surface":"龍且","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005090","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m008-0128","start":128,"end":130,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005074","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m008-0139","start":139,"end":141,"surface":"龍且","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005090","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m008-0146","start":146,"end":147,"surface":"布","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005060","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m008-0149","start":149,"end":150,"surface":"布","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005060","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m008-0157","start":157,"end":159,"surface":"楚王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005074","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m008-0166","start":166,"end":167,"surface":"何","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005087","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu","book_id":"b-shiji-091","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-091-qingbu"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:p011","text":"項籍死，天下定，上置酒。上折隨何之功，謂何為腐儒，為天下安用腐儒。隨何跪曰：「夫陛下引兵攻彭城，楚王未去齊也，陛下發步卒五萬人，騎五千，能以取淮南乎？」上曰：「不能。」隨何曰：「陛下使何與二十人使淮南，至，如陛下之意，是何之功賢於步卒五萬人騎五千也。然而陛下謂何腐儒，為天下安用腐儒，何也？」上曰：「吾方圖子之功。」乃以隨何為護軍中尉。布遂剖符為淮南王，都六，九江、廬江、衡山、豫章郡皆屬布。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m011-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"項籍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005074","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m011-0008","start":8,"end":9,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005086","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m011-0012","start":12,"end":13,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005086","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m011-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"隨何","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005087","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m011-0020","start":20,"end":21,"surface":"何","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005087","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m011-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"隨何","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005087","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m011-0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"楚王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005074","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m011-0076","start":76,"end":77,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005086","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m011-0084","start":84,"end":86,"surface":"隨何","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005087","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m011-0092","start":92,"end":93,"surface":"何","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005087","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m011-0110","start":110,"end":111,"surface":"何","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005087","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m011-0146","start":146,"end":147,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005086","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m011-0160","start":160,"end":162,"su